  "bio": "Step into the serene realm of INSCRIBE TATTOO, where artistry meets precision across their three locations in Ueno, Ikebukuro, and Shinjuku. Thirteen skilled tattoo artists, including women, craft stunning minimalist, illustrative, and dotwork designs, catering to all genres with a personalized touch. For a glimpse into their world or to book your next session, follow the staff's creativity @inscribe_tattoo and explore traditional Japanese tattoos @irezumi_inscribe.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location:\n\n東京タトゥースタジオ｜インスクライブタトゥー\n　\n東京5店舗｜5 studios in Tokyo\n上野・池袋・新宿・原宿・下北沢\nWalk-ins welcome\n　\nワンポイント〜大きな作品まで対応\n個室完備｜女性彫師在籍\n　\n▼ご予約・ご相談はリンクへBook via link▼\n\n東京タトゥースタジオ｜インスクライブタトゥー\n　\n東京5店舗｜5 studios in Tokyo\n上野・池袋・新宿・原宿・下北沢\nWalk-ins welcome\n　\nワンポイント〜大きな作品まで対応\n個室完備｜女性彫師在籍\n　\n▼ご予約・ご相談はリンクへBook via link▼",
